enchants.tooltip:
Your Sprint leaves behind a trail of poison that deals ${20*0.99+0*0..05} Nature damage every second to nearby enemies.

This damage reduces the cooldown of Sprint by 2 seconds but the cooldown can only be reduced once every second.

@ext:This effect does not trigger while in Stealth.:ext@

Using Ambush on a target affected by your Rupture triggers an additional 30% Shadow damage in a 10 yard radius around the target.

While Shadow Dance is active your abilities deal 50% increased damage against monsters below 35% health.

@ext:Deals 20% of the Ambush damage in PvP combat.:ext@

Teaches you: Riposte.

@ext:Can not be used if the Riposte talent is learned.:ext@
